round beneath, and quickly discover the dangers of this unknown region!\nBlast away both enemy and environment around you! Survive the onslaught, decimate everything, win!", "short_description": "*WINNER OF THE GLOBAL VR AWARDS FOR BEST MOBILE VR GAME\n\nImagine becoming a super hero with the ability to shoot beams of concentrated power from you face. You wake up to a pilot telling you some people hired you to go kill some stuff, and that you need to jump out of the ship from 1 thousand feet up to do it. When you land you then blow up everything around you to survive! 35 levels, over 10+ baddies, destructible environment, destructible enemies, and power-ups!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://uforia.com/ptos/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://uforia.com/ptos/", "publisher_name": "Uforia", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://HeroShowdown.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE", "CASUAL", "SHOOTER", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "669651704072625"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12602290_402787233416307_3006445719579000832_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SoGmIYH2lCkQ7kNvwEYkkWd&_nc_oc=Ado2Ldlu9GXbSdYn5ETltdmEe74AJSgRp3Nz2YTxcayBXe7MTbcD5KiD6cSE2nwJhxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVvGkWimKEdzHcxbxLYSncmCQLj17IId8RiUp4nz2WUqw&oe=6B0E